From eda2623b0e5f11c7fcbc57406e7e76d5c498d6c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ishan Gupta <93857652+ishan-crd@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 16:02:38 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Featured films and series with TMDB details, cinema-style
 hero

Titles your apps report (Watch Next) are looked up on TMDB (key from local.properties, never
committed) and shown with backdrop, poster, glass genre chips, facts, plot, Watch / Add to wishlist,
rating and a director-and-cast card. Left/Right switch titles; rows below gain Similar movies
(TMDB recommendations, poster cards that open their details) and a Wishlist. TMDB responses and
images are cached on disk; everything loads off the main thread. Falls back to the app carousel
without a key or matches.
